#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:4
msgid "v5.1.1"
msgstr "v5.1.1"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.1.1 brings OpenMV Viewer up to date with :doc:`OpenMV IDE 5.1.1 "
"<../ide/v5.1.1>`. On Apple Silicon Macs every bundled tool is now a native "
"arm64 build, so firmware updates and recovery keep working on macOS releases"
" that no longer include the Intel translation layer. Nothing changes on "
"Windows or Linux."
msgstr ""
"v5.1.1 使 OpenMV Viewer 与 :doc:`OpenMV IDE 5.1.1 <../ide/v5.1.1>` 保持同步。在 "
"Apple Silicon Mac 上，所有捆绑的工具现在均为原生 arm64 构建，因此在不再包含 Intel 转译层的 macOS "
"版本上，固件更新和恢复仍可正常使用。Windows 和 Linux 上没有任何变化。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:18
msgid "What changed"
msgstr "变更内容"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Native Apple Silicon tools** -- the flashing tools the Viewer uses for "
"firmware updates, recovery, and loading a ROM file system onto the camera "
"are now native arm64 builds on Apple Silicon Macs; the Intel builds failed "
"on recent macOS releases (`36d4d9cf615 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**原生 Apple Silicon 工具**——Viewer 用于固件更新、恢复以及向摄像头加载 ROM 文件系统的烧录工具，现在在 Apple "
"Silicon Mac 上均为原生 arm64 构建；Intel 构建在较新的 macOS 版本上会失败（`36d4d9cf615 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__）。"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:27
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台和工具支持"

